              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadineza ocore cegin dho dhok mac m'okur to lwoŋo: Sadirak, Misaki, kodi Abedinego, ŋecin pa Were ma Jamalo Swa, wok win, aka biye win ka! Ameno jowok i mac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
