              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadineza owaco ni, “Were pa Sadirak, Misaki kodi Abedinego wopak, m'ooro malaika pere botho ŋecin pere ma jogeno i go. Jokwero luwo or pa kere to jojwango delkwoŋ jo makiweno lamo were man je kwanyo woko Were pajo won.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.28",
