              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Riameno amiyo or: Ji mogo je, nono mogo je, kosa dhodhok m'oluwere kwoŋ Were pa Sadirak, Misaki, kodi Abedinego ilatoŋo mathindho thindho t'isika woko udi pajo; kole ongoye were manyalo botho i nger me.”",
          "type": "text",
